# Everything the extension needs at runtime is bundled into out/ by build.mjs,
# so the VSIX ships no node_modules at all. Previously the whole dependency tree
# was packaged, which meant shipping ~21 MB of js-tiktoken.
#
# Deny everything, then allow back only what the extension and the marketplace
# listing need.
**

!out/**
!package.json
!README.md
!CHANGELOG.md
!LICENSE
!icon.png

# Source maps are only emitted for local development builds; keep them out in
# case a dev build ever gets packaged.
out/**/*.map
